1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
You don't wait to feel like running
before you train.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,500
So why are you waiting
to feel social?

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,500
The feeling follows the rep. Not the other way around.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:17,000
A rep is small: Left the apartment. Asked one question.
Stayed 45 minutes. Sent one follow-up.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Track them like training. Because that's what this is.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Start with one social rep today. Link in bio.
